%% Tables: columns measured from content, per-column alignment, a caption.
%%   lmr2svg examples/tables/deck.lmr -o tables.html
!title Tables

!slide A measured table

!table Message schedule ^sched
!cols step[c], message, "value at $x=-1$"[r] | "value at $x=+1$"[r]
!caption Columns size to content and centre as a block; cells may hold maths.

	1 , $\mu_{x_1\to f}$ , 0.5 | 0.5
	2 , $\mu_{f\to x_2}$ , ?   | ?
	---
	3 , marginal $p(x_2)$ , ? | ?
